{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_08_keys_values_entries_01_what_they_include_own_enumerable_string_keyed", "label": "Own enumerable string-keyed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/08-keys-values-entries/01-what-they-include.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MDN's phrase for entries/keys/values. Skips inherited, non-enumerable, and symbol keys. Same set JSON.stringify serialises."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_08_keys_values_entries_01_what_they_include_object_keys", "label": "Object.keys", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/08-keys-values-entries/01-what-they-include.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Returns own enumerable string keys. Default over for...in because it does not walk the prototype chain."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_08_keys_values_entries_01_what_they_include_object_values", "label": "Object.values", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/08-keys-values-entries/01-what-they-include.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_08_keys_values_entries_01_what_they_include_object_entries", "label": "Object.entries", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/08-keys-values-entries/01-what-they-include.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Array of [key, value] pairs for own enumerable string-keyed properties. Keys come back as strings."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_08_keys_values_entries_01_what_they_include_for_in_vs_keys", "label": "for...in vs Object.keys", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/08-keys-values-entries/01-what-they-include.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "for...in enumerates the prototype chain as well. That single difference is why Object.keys should be the default."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_08_keys_values_entries_01_what_they_include_integer_index_order", "label": "Integer-index enumeration order", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/08-keys-values-entries/01-what-they-include.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Integer-index keys come out ascending regardless of insertion. {100,2,7} yields 2, 7, 100. Objects keyed by numeric ID are not ordered collections."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_08_keys_values_entries_01_what_they_include_null_undefined_throw", "label": "Object.keys throws on null and undefined", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/08-keys-values-entries/01-what-they-include.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Non-objects are coerced except null and undefined, which throw TypeError. Guard with ?? {}."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_08_keys_values_entries_01_what_they_include_reflect_ownkeys", "label": "Reflect.ownKeys", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/08-keys-values-entries/01-what-they-include.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Retu